<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever acquires Dutch distributor.</title>
<headline>Unilever acquires Dutch distributor.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever NV said on Friday it had agreed to buy Brocatrade BV, a unit of ACF Holding NV for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Brocatrade is the Dutch distributor of the Clearblue pregnancy tests and the Clearplan fertility tests of Unipath, a unit of Unilever.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition fits in with Unipath's aim to act directly in (for the company) important markets,&quot; Unilever said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
